  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Although not a gunslinger, you have a grit pool at your disposal.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Amateur Gunslinger<sup>UC</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> At the start of each day, you gain a number of grit points equal to your Wisdom modifier (minimum 1), and you gain the ability to perform a single 3rd-level deed from the gunslinger deed class feature. If you have a single grit point left, you can expend one use of your mythic power to perform a deed, rather than spend the grit point.</p>\n<p><strong>Special:</strong> If you gain levels in a class that grants the grit class feature, you can immediately trade this feat for the Mythic Extra Grit feat.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-combat-a-m-feats#toc3\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
